{
  "schemaVersion": "2.0",
  "manifestVersion": "2.0",
  "name": "CrissCross",
  "description": "Real-time two-player board games over a JSON WebSocket protocol for Tic-Tac-Toe, Connect Four, and Checkers. The Socket.IO host is deprecated.",
  "canonicalUrl": "https://harkirat155.github.io/cc/",
  "frontend": {
    "url": "https://harkirat155.github.io/cc/",
    "basePath": "/cc/",
    "stablePages": [
      "https://harkirat155.github.io/cc/",
      "https://harkirat155.github.io/cc/agents"
    ],
    "roomUrlTemplate": "https://harkirat155.github.io/cc/room/{roomId}",
    "ephemeralPaths": [
      "/cc/room/{roomId}",
      "/cc/lobby"
    ]
  },
  "protocol": {
    "type": "websocket-json",
    "url": "https://cc-api.harkirat-hira.workers.dev",
    "webSocketUrl": "wss://cc-api.harkirat-hira.workers.dev",
    "routes": {
      "lobby": "/ws/lobby",
      "room": "/ws/room/{roomId}",
      "newRoom": "/ws/room/new"
    },
    "spec": "https://github.com/Harkirat155/cc/blob/main/docs/ws-protocol.md",
    "envelope": {
      "frame": "{\"t\":\"<event>\",\"id\"?:n,\"d\"?:{...}}",
      "ack": "A client frame with an integer \"id\" gets {\"t\":\"ack\",\"id\":n,\"d\":{...}} back; \"d\" holds an \"error\" string on failure. Frames without \"id\" get no ack.",
      "hello": "The first frame on every socket is {\"t\":\"hello\",\"d\":{\"sid\":string}}.",
      "unknown": "Unparseable and unknown frames are ignored."
    },
    "flow": [
      "Open wss://HOST/ws/lobby and read the hello frame.",
      "Send joinLobby ({\"t\":\"joinLobby\",\"id\":1,\"d\":{\"displayName\":\"Agent Bot\",\"gameId\":\"ttt\"}}); the ack is {\"success\":true,\"position\":n}. When two sockets are queued the lobby sends each of them matchFound with roomId, player (X or O), opponent and a one-time token.",
      "Open /ws/room/{roomId} with the roomId from matchFound. To make a room yourself, open /ws/room/new and send createRoom instead of joinRoom; it seats you as X and the ack is {\"roomId\":string,\"player\":\"X\"}.",
      "On /ws/room/{roomId}, on every socket open (reconnects too), send joinRoom with roomId, clientId and, after a lobby match, the token; the ack is {\"player\":\"X\"|\"O\"|\"spectator\"}. Keep the same clientId across reconnects. Do not send joinRoom on /ws/room/new: createRoom already seated you.",
      "Read gameUpdate. When status is \"active\" and turnSlot is your seat (X is 0, O is 1), send makeMove with roomId and move. makeMove has no ack; an illegal move is dropped silently.",
      "The game is over when gameUpdate.status is not \"active\"; winnerSlot is the winning slot, or \"draw\"."
    ]
  },
  "backend": {
    "url": "https://cc-api.harkirat-hira.workers.dev",
    "healthUrl": "https://cc-api.harkirat-hira.workers.dev/health",
    "feedbackUrl": "https://cc-api.harkirat-hira.workers.dev/feedback"
  },
  "roomId": {
    "format": "5-character uppercase code",
    "alphabet": "ABCDEFGHJKMNPQRSTUVWXYZ23456789",
    "example": "ABCDE"
  },
  "clientIdentity": {
    "clientId": "Stable caller-generated string for seat restoration across reconnects or page refreshes.",
    "displayName": "Human-readable name, 2-20 characters for lobby matchmaking."
  },
  "supportedGames": [
    {
      "id": "ttt",
      "displayName": "Tic-Tac-Toe",
      "players": 2,
      "boardSpec": {
        "kind": "grid",
        "rows": 3,
        "cols": 3
      },
      "playerInfo": [
        {
          "slot": 0,
          "label": "X",
          "color": "sky"
        },
        {
          "slot": 1,
          "label": "O",
          "color": "rose"
        }
      ],
      "moveStyle": "place",
      "movePayload": {
        "event": "makeMove",
        "shape": {
          "roomId": "ABCDE",
          "move": {
            "type": "place",
            "cell": 4
          }
        },
        "legacyShape": {
          "roomId": "ABCDE",
          "index": 4
        },
        "cellSemantics": "Flat board index 0..8, row-major."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "connect4",
      "displayName": "Connect Four",
      "players": 2,
      "boardSpec": {
        "kind": "grid",
        "rows": 6,
        "cols": 7
      },
      "playerInfo": [
        {
          "slot": 0,
          "label": "Red",
          "color": "red"
        },
        {
          "slot": 1,
          "label": "Yellow",
          "color": "amber"
        }
      ],
      "moveStyle": "place",
      "movePayload": {
        "event": "makeMove",
        "shape": {
          "roomId": "ABCDE",
          "move": {
            "type": "place",
            "cell": 3
          }
        },
        "cellSemantics": "Column index 0..6; the disc lands in the lowest empty row."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "checkers",
      "displayName": "Checkers",
      "players": 2,
      "boardSpec": {
        "kind": "grid",
        "rows": 8,
        "cols": 8,
        "dark": true
      },
      "playerInfo": [
        {
          "slot": 0,
          "label": "R",
          "color": "red"
        },
        {
          "slot": 1,
          "label": "Y",
          "color": "amber"
        }
      ],
      "moveStyle": "select-target",
      "rulesNotes": [
        "English-draughts-style dark-square movement.",
        "Single jumps only; multi-jump chains and mandatory captures are not enforced.",
        "Men promote to kings on the opponent back row."
      ],
      "movePayload": {
        "event": "makeMove",
        "stepShape": {
          "roomId": "ABCDE",
          "move": {
            "type": "transfer",
            "from": 42,
            "to": 33
          }
        },
        "captureShape": {
          "roomId": "ABCDE",
          "move": {
            "type": "transfer",
            "from": 42,
            "to": 24,
            "captures": [
              33
            ]
          }
        },
        "cellSemantics": "Flat board index 0..63, row-major. Captures must match a legal single jump."
      }
    }
  ],
  "events": {
    "clientToServer": [
      {
        "name": "createRoom",
        "ack": true,
        "payloadFields": [
          "clientId",
          "displayName",
          "gameId"
        ],
        "ackFields": [
          "player",
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "joinRoom",
        "ack": true,
        "payloadFields": [
          "clientId",
          "displayName",
          "roomId",
          "token"
        ],
        "ackFields": [
          "player"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "updateDisplayName",
        "ack": false,
        "payloadFields": [
          "displayName",
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "leaveRoom",
        "ack": true,
        "payloadFields": [
          "clientId",
          "roomId"
        ],
        "ackFields": [
          "ok"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "makeMove",
        "ack": false,
        "payloadFields": [
          "index",
          "move",
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "resetGame",
        "ack": false,
        "payloadFields": [
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "resetScores",
        "ack": false,
        "payloadFields": [
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "switchGame",
        "ack": true,
        "payloadFields": [
          "gameId",
          "roomId"
        ],
        "ackFields": [
          "gameId",
          "success"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "requestNewGame",
        "ack": false,
        "payloadFields": [
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "cancelNewGameRequest",
        "ack": false,
        "payloadFields": [
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "joinLobby",
        "ack": true,
        "payloadFields": [
          "displayName",
          "gameId"
        ],
        "ackFields": [
          "position",
          "success"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "leaveLobby",
        "ack": true,
        "payloadFields": [],
        "ackFields": [
          "success"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "getLobbyState",
        "ack": true,
        "payloadFields": [],
        "ackFields": [
          "queue"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "voice:join",
        "ack": false,
        "payloadFields": [
          "muted",
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "voice:leave",
        "ack": false,
        "payloadFields": [
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "voice:mute-state",
        "ack": false,
        "payloadFields": [
          "muted",
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "voice:signal",
        "ack": false,
        "payloadFields": [
          "data",
          "roomId",
          "targetId"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "serverToClient": [
      {
        "name": "gameUpdate",
        "payloadFields": [
          "board",
          "boardSpec",
          "gameId",
          "lastEvents",
          "lastMove",
          "lastMoveBy",
          "marks",
          "moveStyle",
          "newGameRequestedAt",
          "newGameRequester",
          "oScore",
          "playerInfo",
          "roomId",
          "roster",
          "scores",
          "status",
          "turn",
          "turnSlot",
          "voiceRoster",
          "winner",
          "winnerSlot",
          "winningCells",
          "winningLine",
          "xScore"
        ],
        "rosterFields": [
          "O",
          "OName",
          "X",
          "XName",
          "spectators"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "gameReset",
        "payloadFields": [
          "gameId",
          "reason",
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "startGame",
        "payloadFields": []
      },
      {
        "name": "lobbyUpdate",
        "payloadFields": [
          "queue",
          "timestamp"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "matchFound",
        "payloadFields": [
          "opponent",
          "player",
          "roomId",
          "token"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "matchError",
        "payloadFields": [
          "error"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "voice:user-joined",
        "payloadFields": [
          "muted",
          "socketId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "voice:user-left",
        "payloadFields": [
          "socketId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "voice:mute-state",
        "payloadFields": [
          "muted",
          "socketId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "voice:signal",
        "payloadFields": [
          "data",
          "from",
          "roomId"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "error",
        "payloadFields": [
          "code",
          "message",
          "retryAfter"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "deprecated": {
